            metadata basisFailureRateBudget : StudyObjective about BlueDog::Requirements::FailureRateBudget { rationale = "Provisional reliability-study objective. Its numerical target and distribution assumptions do not govern finite Gorge qualification and require an accepted mission-specific evidence basis before adoption."; }
